cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "cat_bots: statistical reaction-space reduction, benchmarked on public HTE data"
abstract: >-
  catbots implements a staged reaction-space reduction pipeline (Kennard-Stone ligand selection, metal
  screen, ligand models, substrate clustering, multitask model, Bayesian optimisation) and validates it in
  simulation, using published high-throughput experimentation datasets as oracles, against budget-matched
  random sampling, Bayesian optimisation and generality-aware Bayesian optimisation.
authors:
